  "WITCHER.Chrome.Dissect.Text.Fail": "Провал",
  "WITCHER.Chrome.Dissect.Text.FasterEvery2": "(швидше — кожні <b>2</b> понад СК = +1 влучання)",
  "WITCHER.Chrome.Dissect.Text.HowAutopsyBody": "Pick the setting where the dissection is performed (it adds a flat bonus to your roll), then click one of the category buttons below. If the category has more than one skill, a second dialog lets you pick which to roll. Meet the DC for <b>1 hit</b>. Every additional <b>divisor</b> points above the DC = <b>+1 hit</b>. Each hit reveals one random unknown fact stored on this character's bestiary; already-known facts are re-rolled until something new comes up, and extra hits fizzle once the category is fully known.",
  "WITCHER.Chrome.Dissect.Text.HowAutopsyWorks": "Як працює розтин.",
  "WITCHER.Chrome.Dissect.Text.LeastEfficient": "(найменш ефективно)",
