  "WITCHER.Chrome.PortraitToxicity.Text.AddMatchRow": "Додати рядок збігу",
  "WITCHER.Chrome.PortraitToxicity.Text.Base": "Основа",
  "WITCHER.Chrome.PortraitToxicity.Text.Clear": "Очистити",
  "WITCHER.Chrome.PortraitToxicity.Text.CombineWithRowsAbove": "Об'єднати з рядками вище",
  "WITCHER.Chrome.PortraitToxicity.Text.Condition": "Стан",
  "WITCHER.Chrome.PortraitToxicity.Text.MatchMode": "Режим збігу",
  "WITCHER.Chrome.PortraitToxicity.Text.NoCondition": "без стану",
  "WITCHER.Chrome.PortraitToxicity.Text.NoteBody": "Pick a portrait for each <b>toxicity tier</b>. Tiers are 4 quarters of the actor's toxicity max (Q1–Q4) plus 4 overdose bands past max (OD1–OD4) — bands scale to this actor's max of <b>{maxTox}</b>. Add <b>condition</b> columns matched against a specific surface: per row pick what to scan (status id, effect name, item name, race, profession, or a raw data path) — narrower than the legacy \"Any\" default. For a named source, pick a match mode: <b>contains</b> (substring), <b>equals</b> (exact, case-insensitive), or <b>regex</b> (JS regex, case-insensitive) — so <code>cat</code> can match the AE literally named \"Cat\" but not \"Cat School Witcher\". Each column can hold multiple match rows; the operator dropdown chooses <b>AND</b> or <b>OR</b>. <b>OR binds tighter than AND</b>, so <code>X AND Y OR Z</code> reads as <code>X AND (Y OR Z)</code>. Only effects created directly on the actor OR transferred from an item (<code>transfer:true</code>) count. When multiple columns match, the <b>most specific</b> one wins (highest AND-group count, tiebreak fewest rows, then leftmost); otherwise the <b>Base</b> column shows. Keep the <b>Q1</b> base cell set to the everyday portrait so it swaps back at full sobriety.",
  "WITCHER.Chrome.PortraitToxicity.Text.OR": "OR",
  "WITCHER.Chrome.PortraitToxicity.Text.ORBindsTighterThanAND": "OR має вищий пріоритет, ніж AND",
  "WITCHER.Chrome.PortraitToxicity.Text.PickAPortraitForEach": "Обери портрет для кожного",
  "WITCHER.Chrome.PortraitToxicity.Text.RemoveThisCondition": "Видалити цей стан",
  "WITCHER.Chrome.PortraitToxicity.Text.RemoveThisRow": "Видалити цей рядок",
