  "WITCHER.Effect.CustomStatus.Hint": "Define an item-local status condition. When \"Make Status Condition\" is on + id set, this AE contributes stat / roll / restrict / DoT / auto-hit / ending-check / auto-clear mechanics under that id whenever it's on an actor. The condition is NOT registered in the world Status Effects list — it lives only on this AE. When multiple AEs on the same actor define the same id, the first found wins.",
