  "WITCHER.Effect.CustomStatus.IdHint": "Lowercase, no spaces. Also stamped onto AE.statuses so the token shows this AE's icon as a status. If it matches an existing world status id, this AE's clause OVERRIDES the world one for the affected actor.",
