  "WITCHER.Mech.FoodAndDrink.DietTier.LavishReasonMeal": "A truly fine meal — {item}",
  "WITCHER.Mech.FoodAndDrink.DietTier.StressLineBland": "<div style=\"margin-top:4px;color:#6b3f3f\"><b>+1 stress</b> — bleak diet caught up.</div>",
  "WITCHER.Mech.FoodAndDrink.DietTier.StressLineLavish": "<div style=\"margin-top:4px;color:#4a7c59\"><b>−1 stress</b> — a fine meal lifts the spirit.</div>",
  "WITCHER.Mech.FoodAndDrink.Hangover.Mild": "Похмілля — тупий біль позаду очей і важкий рот. Ти повернешся до себе до заходу сонця.",
  "WITCHER.Mech.FoodAndDrink.Hangover.Moderate": "Похмілля — розплата за минулу ніч. Голова гуде, шлунок у вузлі, кожен кидок ВІД як вилазити з колодязя. Виспись.",
  "WITCHER.Mech.FoodAndDrink.Hangover.Severe": "Hangover — existence is suffering. Light is an assault, sound a punishment, and the very thought of food is offensive. Every breath reminds you of the choices that brought you here. You are not getting out of bed unless someone drags you out.",
  "WITCHER.Mech.FoodAndDrink.More.Bite": "another bite",
