  "WITCHER.Sheet.Shield.Tooltip.ShieldBashCoreP164AMeleeAttackDealingBlu": "Shield bash (Core p.164) — a Melee attack dealing bludgeoning, lethal damage equal to your Punch shifted up by shield size (medium +2 Body levels, heavy +4). Capped at 1d6+8.",
